WEBVTT

00:01.610 --> 00:03.780
<b>Wow, ten minutes goes by fast.</b>

00:04.080 --> 00:07.420
<b>Oh, I mean five minutes.</b>

00:10.920 --> 00:13.690
<b>We haven't talked
about Puchiko much.</b>

00:14.090 --> 00:16.460
<b>Oh, can you tell us about Puchiko?</b>

00:19.200 --> 00:24.470
<b>Even though she appears
from the first episode,</b>

00:24.570 --> 00:28.030
<b>and introduces herself,</b>

00:28.140 --> 00:31.040
<b>she doesn't have a big role.</b>

00:31.580 --> 00:38.070
<b>So viewers probably
only thought she was cute.</b>

00:39.750 --> 00:43.810
<b>But when Murataku appears,</b>

00:45.730 --> 00:49.890
<b>then she gets a bigger role.</b>

00:50.830 --> 00:52.730
<b>That's true.</b>

00:52.830 --> 00:58.130
<b>You can't tell initially that
she has a sharp tongue.</b>

00:58.600 --> 01:01.100
<b>Oh, this is when Minataku appears.</b>

01:02.240 --> 01:05.610
<b>At the time, the animation staff
really liked Puchiko.</b>

01:12.450 --> 01:18.390
<b>In the original concept,
Minataku was a cute young boy.</b>

01:20.230 --> 01:23.560
<b>We didn't expect him to turn out
as this type of character.</b>

01:25.930 --> 01:31.100
<b>We didn't know what would happen
to the characters we made</b>

01:31.200 --> 01:34.570
<b>especially for the TV series.</b>

01:34.670 --> 01:36.640
<b>No we didn't.</b>

01:40.510 --> 01:44.310
<b>I like how these two meet.</b>

01:46.390 --> 01:48.910
<b>Sharp comment there.</b>

01:52.290 --> 01:58.750
<b>They look like they would
have a normal romance,</b>

01:59.270 --> 02:02.230
<b>even though it's not normal at all.</b>

02:08.110 --> 02:11.630
<b>You'd think
he'd comment about her ears.</b>

02:11.740 --> 02:14.080
<b>Oh, instead of the dice?</b>

02:15.310 --> 02:16.980
<b>Does Minataku have pierced ears?</b>

02:17.080 --> 02:18.050
<b>Yes he does.</b>

02:18.150 --> 02:19.640
<b>I didn't know until now!</b>

02:20.350 --> 02:22.680
<b>You didn't?
After all these years?</b>

02:22.790 --> 02:24.720
<b>He's fashionable?</b>

02:24.820 --> 02:27.050
<b>Yes, slightly fashionable.</b>

02:27.790 --> 02:33.390
<b>Someone who doesn't have
much to do with Akihabara.</b>

02:34.730 --> 02:36.500
<b>He's that type.</b>

02:40.470 --> 02:43.600
<b>I wonder what this is?
Things like this appear all the time.</b>

02:43.710 --> 02:45.840
<b>Whose foot is it?</b>

02:49.320 --> 02:51.280
<b>Is this how an actual
Gamers store looks?</b>

02:51.380 --> 02:53.080
<b>Oh,just like this.</b>

02:53.190 --> 02:55.310
<b>Don't tell them lies.</b>

02:59.590 --> 03:01.750
<b>''Iron Leg Johnny''?</b>

03:27.150 --> 03:29.880
<b>This is what I mean
by no conclusion.</b>

03:32.160 --> 03:34.350
<b>A perfect example of one?</b>

03:34.460 --> 03:37.090
<b>We didn't understand
this one at all.</b>

03:39.170 --> 03:43.300
<b>This episode continues
later on, though.</b>

03:43.400 --> 03:45.740
<b>Yes, it does.</b>
